        "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued November 21 at 11:11AM AST by NWS San Juan PR",
        "description": "According to the Pacific Tsunami Warning Center an earthquake\noccurred about 65 miles northwest of Isla de Isla Mona at 1100 AM\nAST.\n\nBased on location and magnitude the earthquake was not sufficient\nto generate a tsunami damaging to Puerto Rico and the US Virgin\nIslands. Some of these areas may experience non-damaging sea\nlevel changes.",
